ARTICLE V — THE CANNABIS PRINCIPLE

Cannabis shall not be declared a universal longevity treatment.

Instead:

[
C_{weed}

f(Dose,Frequency,Route,Age,Health,Context).
]

Smoking additionally introduces combustion exposure.

Therefore:

[
\boxed{
Cannabis\ exposure\neq Longevity\ axiom
}
]

MFM permits cannabis to be studied empirically while refusing to convert preference into scientific fact.

