Every new observation shall update the model.

[
P(H|Data)
\propto
P(Data|H)P(H).
]

Therefore:

[
Posterior

Prior\times Evidence.
]

This creates the fundamental MFM cycle:

[
\boxed{
Hypothesis
\rightarrow
Prediction
\rightarrow
Observation
\rightarrow
Bayesian\ Update
\rightarrow
New\ Hypothesis
}
]

