ARTICLE XIX — THE FINAL AXIOM

The highest principle of Mathematical Futurological Medicine is:

[
\boxed{
\textbf{No intervention is sacred; no hypothesis is beyond revision.}
}
]

And therefore:

[
\boxed{
\text{Observe}
\rightarrow
\text{Measure}
\rightarrow
\text{Formalize}
\rightarrow
\text{Predict}
\rightarrow
\text{Test}
\rightarrow
\text{Learn}
\rightarrow
\text{Improve}
}
]

repeats indefinitely.

This recursive process constitutes the Mathematical Futurological Medical Method.

Its ultimate objective is:

[
\boxed{
\lim_{t\rightarrow\infty}
P(\text{optimal personalized medical decision at }t)
\rightarrow1
}
]

while recognizing that individual biological outcomes remain probabilistic.

Thus is Mathematical Futurological Medicine formally established as a research philosophy and mathematical framework for the future of personalized human health.
